{"parentUuid":"1deeda28-950a-4e33-a33f-9e8e5395ef02","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W4mKNCVSWQYDzEj7wu1N86","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Call of Duty Vanguard campaign Hamburg rain night screenshot callofduty.com blog\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"komplettloesung guide fuer die kampagne alle trophaeen achievements 311172\",\"url\":\"https://www.gameswelt.de/call-of-duty-vanguard/komplettloesung/komplettloesung-guide-fuer-die-kampagne-alle-trophaeen-achievements-311172\"},{\"title\":\"PS5 review: Wild gunfights on various fronts\",\"url\":\"https://outnow.REDACTED\"},{\"title\":\"phoenix mission walkthrough\",\"url\":\"https://www.gfinityesports.com/call-of-duty-vanguard/phoenix-mission-walkthrough/\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard Campaign Leaks Ahead of Release Time\",\"url\":\"https://www.denofgeek.com/games/call-of-duty-vanguard-campaign-leak-release-time/\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard Campaign Leaks Ahead of Release Time\",\"url\":\"https://www.denofgeek.com/?p=725141\"},{\"title\":\"‘Call of Duty: Vanguard’ Review: Looking to the Past to Find a Way Forward\",\"url\":\"https://www.slantmagazine.com/games/call-of-duty-vanguard-review\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty: Vanguard\",\"url\":\"https://callofduty.fandom.com/wiki/Call_of_Duty:_Vanguard?so=search\"},{\"title\":\"call of duty vanguard\",\"url\":\"https://www.co-op.gg/pc/game/call-of-duty-vanguard\"},{\"title\":\"cod vanguard alle missionen spielzeit,3374949\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamepro.de/artikel/cod-vanguard-alle-missionen-spielzeit,3374949.html\"}]\n\nI didn't find the official callofduty.com blog post or any screenshot from the Hamburg rain scene. The results do describe the Hamburg opening mission, which is called \"Phoenix.\"\n\n- **Mission setup:** A gaming guide places the opening mission in Hamburg in 1945, with the player's train closing in on a second train. The doors of a moving train are opened onto a war-torn Hamburg soaked by heavy rain and explosions. That matches the rain scene you're describing.\n- **Story context:** One review says the campaign tasks a mixed special unit of Allied nations with securing documents about the secret Project Phoenix in Hamburg shortly before the end of the war. Another says the game opens with a train hijacking outside Hamburg in April 1945, shortly before Hitler's suicide.\n- **Mission list:** A German guide lists nine campaign missions, with Phoenix in Hamburg as the first. The campaign is split into nine chapters or missions.\n\nSearch results were mostly third-party sites (Gfinity, Slant, Outnow, GamesWelt, GamePro). The Hamburg details are consistent across them, but none are official Activision material.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"cd15e027-679b-40bb-aa05-3fece96b7837","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:09:15.858Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Call of Duty Vanguard campaign Hamburg rain night screenshot callofduty.com blog","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_017hUvTBa6hhCUWgEsY9WCbL","content":[{"title":"komplettloesung guide fuer die kampagne alle trophaeen achievements 311172","url":"https://www.gameswelt.de/call-of-duty-vanguard/komplettloesung/komplettloesung-guide-fuer-die-kampagne-alle-trophaeen-achievements-311172"},{"title":"PS5 review: Wild gunfights on various fronts","url":"https://outnow.REDACTED"},{"title":"phoenix mission walkthrough","url":"https://www.gfinityesports.com/call-of-duty-vanguard/phoenix-mission-walkthrough/"},{"title":"Call of Duty Vanguard Campaign Leaks Ahead of Release Time","url":"https://www.denofgeek.com/games/call-of-duty-vanguard-campaign-leak-release-time/"},{"title":"Call of Duty Vanguard Campaign Leaks Ahead of Release Time","url":"https://www.denofgeek.com/?p=725141"},{"title":"‘Call of Duty: Vanguard’ Review: Looking to the Past to Find a Way