ugh, and rolls low dark spray","     and smoke along the ground (mud and dirt are lit on the side facing a"]},{"oldStart":285,"oldLines":7,"newStart":286,"newLines":8,"lines":["     tracers and sparks never","     thinner than a pixel and a half, so fire from a hundred metres off is","     still an unbroken line), `flames.js` (the","-    fires as flame: three billboards per near fire, each a turbulent body","+    fires as flame: five billboards over the breadth of each near fire,","+    rising two to three metres out of the wreck, each a turbulent body","     of flame worked out in its shader, licking up in tongues, coloured by","     its heat from deep red to a yellow-white core), `plumes.js` (each","     fire's smoke climbing ~90 m on from its particles: a ribbon turned to"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"26a60f92-f21a-4b6f-bda8-a7ce43a43842","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c951c25e-24f9-4ff9-92fa-a044ff39055f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"exte