{"parentUuid":"a6a851e5-34b2-4d09-87fa-c2bdad48e60b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGQowscaEqctADSgi6FL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The truck now shows the flame body, embers, dark smoke, and ground fires it was previously missing, matching the CoD wreck fire look. Now writing up notes and wrapping up.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":663916,"output_tokens":1444,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":193},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1210,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1444,"cache_read_input_tokens":663916,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1210,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1210},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"4766aa37-afb8-4bf7-b1c4-f0a90d7e9852","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGQotH4stoF8pSBa2vB7","requestRef":"46d527c0-c61e-4a0b-ba2b-b02053140836","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"026e045e-2ccb-4887-90a4-3a0d4360a6c7","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:31:05.570Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"REDACTED","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"026e045e-2ccb-4887-90a4-3a0d4360a6c7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGQowscaEqctADSgi6FL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0197tz5DKyVvt3grTf5qtDrw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, third (the gap the Stop hook named: CoD fires bigger, more sparks):\n  Reference re-viewed: CoD: WWII tank frame (img.opencritic.com/game/4505/o/qmtcJEVe.jpg), zoomed on\n  the wreck fire: big yellow-orange flame body, dozens of burning bits/sparks around and on the\n  ground, dark smoke above. Fire view script: scratchpad fire_views.js (close/mid/far/ruin, tag).\n- e1b9a715 flames.js: PER 3 -> 5 billboards spread over the fire's breadth, h (1.8 + 1.1 share) s,\n  w (0.95 + 0.45 share) s, base f.y - 0.25.\n- fa8fe595 effects.js: embers 0.26 -> 0.55 per tick; spark showers every 1.5-4.5 s (14-25, vy 3.5-7.5,\n  gravity 2.5, 0.8-2.2 s) per fire (f.pop), none for far fires.\n- f9d442ba effects.js: fire smoke 0.35 -> 0.7 per tick, #1c1a18 a0.75, size1 (5-8) s, vy 1.2-2.1,\n  spread over the breadth; the plume (plumes.js) now has a dense base to come out of.\n- 6f9f7795 debris fires: props with `debris: n` (truck 4, halftrack 3) scatter small fires\n  (0.2-0.35) 1.8-3.6 m out, insideSolid-checked, seeded by position; effects.debris is its own list\n  (flames.js and updateFires read it; plumes, distort, smoulder and the sky's fire glow don't);\n  smoke/embers/showers scale with min(1, size); flames.js MAXF 6 -> 10.\n  Checked: low/medium/high compile with fires in view, 9 node checks, merge-tree clean. Cost: the\n  whole truck fire from 6 m on high = ~2.0 ms GPU (25 flame quads, ~1100 particles; the big dark\n  smoke sprites are the likely bulk) - the place to trim if the frame budget is tight.\nEOF\ncd REDACTED && node hl.mjs stop; for i in $(seq 1 15); do pgrep -f chrome-headless-shell >/dev/null || break; sleep 1; done; rm -rf hl-profile; pgrep -fl chrome-headless-shell || echo \"no headless processes\"","description":"Write the notes and stop the headless browser","timeout":60000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":663916,"output_tokens":1444,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":193},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1210,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1444,"cache_read_input_tokens":663916,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1210,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1210},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_0197tz5DKyVvt3grTf5qtDrw":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, third (the gap the Stop hook named: CoD fires bigger, more sparks):\n  Reference re-viewed: CoD: WWII tank frame (img.opencritic.com/game/4505/o/qmtcJEVe.jpg), zoomed on\n  the wreck fire: big yellow-orange flame body, dozens of burning bits/sparks around and on the\n  ground, dark smoke above. Fire view script: scratchpad fire_views.js (close/mid/far/ruin, tag).\n- e1b9a715 flames.js: PER 3 -> 5 billboards spread over the fire's breadth, h (1.8 + 1.1 share) s,\n  w (0.95 + 0.45 share) s, base f.y - 0.25.\n- fa8fe595 effects.js: embers 0.26 -> 0.55 per tick; spark showers every 1.5-4.5 s (14-25, vy 3.5-7.5,\n  gravity 2.5, 0.8-2.2 s) per fire (f.pop), none for far fires.\n- f9d442ba effects.js: fire smoke 0.35 -> 0.7 per tick, #1c1a18 a0.75, size1 (5-8) s, vy 1.2-2.1,\n  spread over the breadth; the plume (plumes.js) now has a dense base to come out of.\n- 6f9f7795 debris fires: props with `debris: n` (truck 4, halftrack 3) scatter small fires\n  (0.2-0.35) 1.8-3.6 m out, insideSolid-checked, seeded by position; effects.debris is its own list\n  (flames.js and updateFires read it; plumes, distort, smoulder and the sky's fire glow don't);\n  smoke/embers/showers scale with min(1, size); flames.js MAXF 6 -> 10.\n  Checked: low/medium/high compile with fires in view, 9 node checks, merge-tree clean. Cost: the\n  whole truck fire from 6 m on high = ~2.0 ms GPU (25 flame quads, ~1100 particles; the big dark\n  smoke sprites are the likely bulk) - the place to trim if the frame budget is tight.\nEOF\ncd REDACTED && node hl.mjs stop; for i in $(seq 1 15); do pgrep -f chrome-headless-shell >/dev/null || break; sleep 1; done; rm -rf hl-profile; pgrep -fl chrome-headless-shell || echo \"no headless processes\"","description":"Write the notes and stop the headless browser","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":60000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"4766aa37-afb8-4bf7-b1c4-f0a90d7e9852","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgGQotH4stoF8pSBa2vB7","requestRef":"46d527c0-c61e-4a0b-ba2b-b02053140836","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8cce4fae-ec6a-45c6-9287-60d8b114784c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:31:15.143Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"REDACTED","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
