{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:32:19.707Z","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"local_7d29cad9-bdd3-4987-9ed1-e8d4d12a5721\" name=\"WW2 arcade 3D shooter POC\">\nBrowser tabs: the first-person session now tests in its own tab \"tab-1\" (server on port 8765, serving the hedgerow-poc worktree). Tab \"seed\" is yours: point it at your own server/port, and please don't use tab-1 or port 8765.\n</cross-session-message>"}
