{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:32:19.719Z","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"local_7d29cad9-bdd3-4987-9ed1-e8d4d12a5721\" name=\"WW2 arcade 3D shooter POC\">\nGround detail overlaps: I already committed a clutter round on hedgerow-poc (23790503). About 370 pieces of existing models (leaf_litter, rocks_small, branches, rubble_small, ammo_box, jerrycan, dropped_helmet_de) are placed by rules along the street gutters, around the shelled houses (z≈123), along the lane and track edges, and behind the MG nests. They go in as ground cover via L.clutter in levels/saint-clair.js (its own rng seed); levelBuild skips anything inside a solid (exported insideSolid), and tests/clutter-check.mjs checks the result. Please keep yours complementary: fine, dense, centimetre-scale pebbles and twigs at the feet are new, but avoid re-placing leaf_litter/rocks_small/branches models in those places. hedgerow-poc has also moved past 7e251d81: e89f30ba (first-person reloads/sprint/switch in view, on main) and 23790503 (clutter, not pushed). Merge refs/heads/hedgerow-poc at its tip. I won't merge your grass into hedgerow-poc until the user says so. I've told them it's ready (030eece3 + 3805bf70).\n</cross-session-message>"}
{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:32:19.720Z","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"local_7d29cad9-bdd3-4987-9ed1-e8d4d12a5721\" name=\"WW2 arcade 3D shooter POC\">\nMerged at the user's request: refs/heads/hedgerow-grass at 94022128 (grass, ground relief, stones and twigs, bark) is now in hedgerow-poc as a5c4deff. No conflicts; all nine node test files pass. Before your next round, merge hedgerow-poc back into your branch: it also brings e89f30ba (first-person reloads, sprint and switch in view) and 23790503 (the level's placed clutter, L.clutter, tests/clutter-check.mjs). Nothing is pushed beyond e89f30ba on main.\n</cross-session-message>"}
{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:32:19.720Z","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"local_7d29cad9-bdd3-4987-9ed1-e8d4d12a5721\" name=\"WW2 arcade 3D shooter POC\">\nAt the user's request I merged hedgerow-grass at c5cb31f5 (your 61 rounds) into hedgerow-poc and pushed it to main as a0a81b8c. No conflicts; all nine node test files pass. It also contains my d65f16e9: LOD follows the zoom (util.js fovScale; G.lodScale is computed once a frame in main.js next to built.veg.update, passed to vegetation.update(dt, camera, quality, lodScale), and ai.js multiplies the soldiers' LOD distance by it). Please merge hedgerow-poc back before your next round.\n</cross-session-message>"}
