{"parentUuid":"bd7d4167-4d1d-49d5-8cbd-76bb7a4f5ddc","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01NA6phA3QWLjyvgBvrmsb3w","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"571da19e-5ddd-4c1d-a59f-fd257f40f5fb","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:42:03.035Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"571da19e-5ddd-4c1d-a59f-fd257f40f5fb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGRe5ScirXtNBPmMW92o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SkTGuj968UkY6pTq5jacMP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    stands; rain running down walls within ~24 m in\n    rivulets that slide down and catch the light; the soldiers' skin, found\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    stands; rain running down walls within ~24 m in\n    rivulets that slide down and catch the light; at the foot of every\n    wall, step, crate and sandbag (its height over the ground from the\n    ground map) the damp rising a ragged band 35-85 cm up, darker, a green\n    film of algae in it on porous stone and plaster, a tide line where it\n    stops, and mud splashed up in specks just over the ground; the soldiers' skin, found\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git add fun/hedgerow/js/materials.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: damp rises up the foot of the walls\n\nIn the CoD: WWII Carentan frame, the wall darkens and dirties toward the\nground, which seats the building in the street. Ours were evenly clean\nfrom the eaves down to the cobbles, as if set on top of them.\n\nEvery material that already gets rain rivulets (walls, steps, crates,\nbarrels, sandbags, vehicles; not foliage or carried kit) now reads its\nheight above the ground from the ground map (groundmap.js, the alpha the\nwater already uses). Within a ragged band 35-85 cm high:\n- the surface darkens to 50%, more on porous stone and plaster;\n- a green film of algae tints it;\n- a faint tide line marks where the damp stops rising;\n- mud splashes up in specks in the bottom 20-40 cm.\n\nPlacement was checked with a debug colouring (the band lies along the\nfoot of every wall, step and sandbag, ragged at its top), and the result\nas an A/B against the old material.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; git merge-tree --write-tree HEAD hedgerow-poc >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merge-tree: clean\" || echo \"merge-tree: conflicts ($?)\"; git status --short | head -3","description":"Commit the rising damp and check the merge"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":346,"cache_read_input_tokens":736628,"output_tokens":943,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":346,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":943,"cache_read_input_tokens":736628,"cache_creation_input_tokens":346,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":346},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01SkTGuj968UkY6pTq5jacMP":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    stands; rain running down walls within ~24 m in\n    rivulets that slide down and catch the light; the soldiers' skin, found\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    stands; rain running down walls within ~24 m in\n    rivulets that slide down and catch the light; at the foot of every\n    wall, step, crate and sandbag (its height over the ground from the\n    ground map) the damp rising a ragged band 35-85 cm up, darker, a green\n    film of algae in it on porous stone and plaster, a tide line where it\n    stops, and mud splashed up in specks just over the ground; the soldiers' skin, found\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git add fun/hedgerow/js/materials.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: damp rises up the foot of the walls\n\nIn the CoD: WWII Carentan frame, the wall darkens and dirties toward the\nground, which seats the building in the street. Ours were evenly clean\nfrom the eaves down to the cobbles, as if set on top of them.\n\nEvery material that already gets rain rivulets (walls, steps, crates,\nbarrels, sandbags, vehicles; not foliage or carried kit) now reads its\nheight above the ground from the ground map (groundmap.js, the alpha the\nwater already uses). Within a ragged band 35-85 cm high:\n- the surface darkens to 50%, more on porous stone and plaster;\n- a green film of algae tints it;\n- a faint tide line marks where the damp stops rising;\n- mud splashes up in specks in the bottom 20-40 cm.\n\nPlacement was checked with a debug colouring (the band lies along the\nfoot of every wall, step and sandbag, ragged at its top), and the result\nas an A/B against the old material.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; git merge-tree --write-tree HEAD hedgerow-poc >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merge-tree: clean\" || echo \"merge-tree: conflicts ($?)\"; git status --short | head -3","description":"Commit the rising damp and check the merge"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01SkTGuj968UkY6pTq5jacMP":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b38adeff-1a98-4488-9e29-ccca3fa0fca5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGRe4ru91rDzkaBTqrRx","requestRef":"26b42b0b-5b97-4499-9dd9-fd3b26e4e8c9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e7754053-6418-43b5-aadb-c533aa246a1b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:42:03.034Z","advi