{"parentUuid":"5bbe4fb7-97a2-49c6-9e12-916eae708e3f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGS9zSLFdRs1yXBeXpCL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QZwujCayiGH7pdxyhQRDEk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, fourth (no pane: server from the shell, headless only):\n- c597cb3d rising damp: materials.js addWeather, for `streaks` materials: height over the ground from\n  shared.grassMap .w (the ground map's mesh heights, the water's bed) -> mDamp band 35-85 cm (ragged,\n  dampNoise), x0.5 on porous, algae tint, tide line, mud specks in the bottom 20-40 cm; roughness\n  follows. Placement verified with a debug colouring (red band / green mud) - lies along every wall,\n  step, crate, sandbag foot. First strength (x0.7) was invisible at night; x0.5 + algae reads.\n- dd358324 fire bounce: fill.js FIRE_UNIFORMS (uFires[4] moved here; materials' SMOULDER_UNIFORMS is\n  an alias; updateSmoulder fills it) + uBounce; addFireBounce(shader, pos, nrm) adds fireBounce() to\n  `irradiance` before lights_fragment_end (inside #if RE_IndirectDiffuse) in every addWeather\n  material and in terrain.js. size^2 * wrap / (r^2 + 4) * 6, gone by 20 m, wrap clamp(0.35 + 0.65\n  dot, 0.05, 1) (the first wrap 0.55 + 0.45 dot lit the ruin's facade through its wall). A/B needs\n  the fires' flicker frozen (G.lights.statics[].flicker = 0) - otherwise the +-45% flicker swamps it.\n  Result: darker half of the frame +2.2-2.8 levels (+7-15%) near the fires.\n  Not seen in a real browser window: everything above was checked in headless renders only.\nEOF\ncd REDACTED && node hl.mjs stop; for i in $(seq 1 15); do pgrep -f chrome-headless-shell >/dev/null || break; sleep 1; done; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; pgrep -fl chrome-headless-shell || echo \"no headless processes\"; pgrep -fl \"nocache_server.py\" || echo \"no test server\"; lsof -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"8766 still listening\" || echo \"8766 free\"; [ -f /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/launch.json ] && echo \"launch.json exists (not mine)\" || echo \"no launch.json\"; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass status --short | head -3; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass log --oneline -3","description":"Record the round in the notes and shut down the rig","timeout":60000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1260,"cache_read_input_tokens":772869,"output_tokens":1766,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":507},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1260,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1766,"cache_read_input_tokens":772869,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1260,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1260},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01QZwujCayiGH7pdxyhQRDEk":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, fourth (no pane: server from the shell, headless only):\n- c597cb3d rising damp: materials.js addWeather, for `streaks` materials: height over the ground from\n  shared.grassMap .w (the ground map's mesh heights, the water's bed) -> mDamp band 35-85 cm (ragged,\n  dampNoise), x0.5 on porous, algae tint, tide line, mud specks in the bottom 20-40 cm; roughness\n  follows. Placement verified with a debug colouring (red band / green mud) - lies along every wall,\n  step, crate, sandbag foot. First strength (x0.7) was invisible at night; x0.5 + algae reads.\n- dd358324 fire bounce: fill.js FIRE_UNIFORMS (uFires[4] moved here; materials' SMOULDER_UNIFORMS is\n  an alias; updateSmoulder fills it) + uBounce; addFireBounce(shader, pos, nrm) adds fireBounce() to\n  `irradiance` before lights_fragment_end (inside #if RE_IndirectDiffuse) in every addWeather\n  material and in terrain.js. size^2 * wrap / (r^2 + 4) * 6, gone by 20 m, wrap clamp(0.35 + 0.65\n  dot, 0.05, 1) (the first wrap 0.55 + 0.45 dot lit the ruin's facade through its wall). A/B needs\n  the fires' flicker frozen (G.lights.statics[].flicker = 0) - otherwise the +-45% flicker swamps it.\n  Result: darker half of the frame +2.2-2.8 levels (+7-15%) near the fires.\n  Not seen in a real browser window: everything above was checked in headless renders only.\nEOF\ncd REDACTED && node hl.mjs stop; for i in $(seq 1 15); do pgrep -f chrome-headless-shell >/dev/null || break; sleep 1; done; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; pgrep -fl chrome-headless-shell || echo \"no headless processes\"; pgrep -fl \"nocache_server.py\" || echo \"no test server\"; lsof -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"8766 still listening\" || echo \"8766 free\"; [ -f /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/launch.json ] && echo \"launch.json exists (not mine)\" || echo \"no launch.json\"; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass status --short | head -3; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass log --oneline -3","description":"Record the round in the notes and shut down the rig","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":60000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"76bd279f-f4a2-4340-98da-83af24e8f582","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgGS9ysbfMLttcV6Bp3ir","requestRef":"52e9a0a5-4317-4a2d-b407-ccf3c424061f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant"