{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"b824a9aa6057d39fb032c0beab2f8e8fa988e3a1fdced46dd1882003eeca79d0","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed the reflection pass only handles level surfaces, so my glass marking has no effect; supporting upright glass would need a new alpha channel range and changes to both the reflection and volumetric passes. I'm now checking what else reads that alpha channel before deciding if it's worth the risk.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QUsCergsZ25Ua7LLvP3vcN","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && grep -n \"\\.a \\* 4\\|src\\.a\\|tSrc, .*)\\.a\" js/*.js | head -20","description":"Find every pass that reads the scene's alpha channel"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
