{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"df637990303b913ad0ffb886956db869c13a275d573b5faf0f37118c543cea84","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'll filter out ray hits too close to the origin to avoid mid-air splash artifacts from starting-inside-collider cases. Confirmed `world.js` only imports `util.js` with no circular dependency, so I'll proceed with the implementation.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NgBFB6FrceAkUG5ynb7UpB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='js/weather.js'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"import { rng } from './util.js';\n\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"import { rng } from './util.js';\nimport { SHOT } from './world.js';\n\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new,1)\nold=\"\"\"export function createWeather({ count = 8000, terrain, water = null, onThunder, seed = 4 }) {\n  const R = rng(seed);\n  // where a drop lands: the ground, or the river's surface over it\n  const landY = (x, z) => {\n    const y = terrain ? terrain.height(x, z) : 0;\n    return water && y < water.level && water.contains(x, z) ? water.level : y;\n  };\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"export function createWeather({ count = 8000, terrain, water = null, world = null, onThunder, seed = 4 }) {\n  const R = rng(seed);\n  // where a drop lands: the first thing in its way from above (a crate's lid, a sandbag, the truck's\n  // bonnet, a step, a roof - so what is sheltered under it stays dry), else the ground, or the\n  // river's surface over it\n  const landY = (x, z) => {\n    let y = terrain ? terrain.height(x, z) : 0;\n    if (water && y < water.level && water.contains(x, z)) y = water.level;\n    if (world) {\n      const h = world.raycast(x, y + 30, z, 0, -1, 0, 30.05, SHOT, { noTerrain: true, noWater: true });\n      // (not from inside something tall, where the ray starts: that is no top)\n      if (h && h.t > 0.01 && h.ny > 0.5 && h.y > y + 0.02) y = h.y;\n    }\n    return y;\n  };\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='js/main.js'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    count: quality.rain, terrain: G.terrain, water: LEVEL.water,\n    onThunder: (t) => audio.thunder(t),\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    count: quality.rain, terrain: G.terrain, water: LEVEL.water, world: G.world,\n    onThunder: (t) => audio.thunder(t),\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nfor f in weather main; do cp js/$f.js $TMPDIR/chk_$f.mjs; node --check $TMPDIR/chk_$f.mjs && echo \"$f ok\"; rm -f $TMPDIR/chk_$f.mjs; done; sed -n 232,240p js/main.js","description":"Land rain splashes on the first surface from above"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
