{"parentUuid":"e81f6a83-2dd3-444c-9cc3-8333cdef9ff4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17b7ed16-a101-4402-afdd-06026f97016b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Stop hook feedback:\n[constantly and iteratively improve the game graphics towards aaa game (call of duty, medal of honor). commit each improvement.]: The commit clause is met: many 'Hedgerow graphics' commits exist (e.g. 556743c5, d3b2687c, 7dbc8488, 511e29af, aa3d8604, ce04cce6, e1b9a715, fa8fe595, f9d442ba, 6f9f7795, c597cb3d, dd358324, 87bdf2f5). But the open-ended clause 'constantly and iteratively improve the game graphics towards AAA (Call of Duty / Medal of Honor) quality' is not established. Work is done in per-turn rounds that each end in teardown, the last round reverted its window-glass attempt without a visible gain, the last message says 'Nothing is pushed' and 'I checked everything only in headless renders, not in a browser window', and it cites no completed match to AAA parity; the reference comparisons rest on a few frames and self-judged gaps. Iterating is ongoing rather than the condition being satisfied."},"isMeta":true,"uuid":"e315cdfd-5584-4c1b-8a07-707782ef9b02","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:00:06.558Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"REDACTED","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
