{"parentUuid":"6c2341f0-92e5-4d76-9e2b-23444532f7ba","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17b7ed16-a101-4402-afdd-06026f97016b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qfedjq59fGW4nAV39DDh5L","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Call of Duty Vanguard Operation Tonga full mission gameplay youtube\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard on PS5 and Xbox One X – The DVDfever Review\",\"url\":\"https://dvd-fever.co.uk/call-of-duty-vanguard-on-ps5-and-xbox-one-x-the-dvdfever-review/\"},{\"title\":\"92656 call of duty vanguard le battaglie che lo hanno ispirato\",\"url\":\"https://www.animeclick.it/news/92656-call-of-duty-vanguard-le-battaglie-che-lo-hanno-ispirato\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard le battaglie che lo hanno ispirato\",\"url\":\"https://www.animeclick.it/news/amp/92656-call-of-duty-vanguard-le-battaglie-che-lo-hanno-ispirato.amp.html\"},{\"title\":\"campaign mission list\",\"url\":\"https://www.gfinityesports.com/call-of-duty-vanguard/campaign-mission-list/\"},{\"title\":\"www.gameswelt.de\",\"url\":\"https://www.gameswelt.de/call-of-duty-vanguard/komplettloesung/komplettloesung-guide-fuer-die-kampagne-alle-trophaeen-achievements-311172/2\"},{\"title\":\"Call Of Duty: Vanguard: Operation Tonga Walkthrough -- Where To Hide\",\"url\":\"https://gamespot.REDACTED\"},{\"title\":\"cod vanguard alle missionen spielzeit,3374949\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamepro.de/artikel/cod-vanguard-alle-missionen-spielzeit,3374949.html\"},{\"title\":\"call of duty vanguardset during wwiiwill be released on november 5th\",\"url\":\"https://www.guru3d.com/news-story/call-of-duty-vanguardset-during-wwiiwill-be-released-on-november-5th.html\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty: Vanguard Review (PC) – Familiar Territory\",\"url\":\"https://mp1st.com/?p=169993\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up a YouTube video of the full Operation Tonga mission. It returned written material only, including a walkthrough on GameSpot that covers the mission's opening section and a German guide with trophy details. A DVDfever review also includes a full PS5 gameplay walkthrough of the campaign, though it isn't specific to this mission.\n\nHere's what the results say about the mission:\n\n- **Setup:** In Operation Tonga, you play as Arthur Kingsley, during the British Sixth Airborne Division's assault on Normandy on D-Day.\n- **Opening:** Kingsley loses his equipment, save for a knife, and must proceed to kill some Nazis without his typical gear. The GameSpot guide covers hiding and getting a weapon in that section.\n- **Later stages:** A review notes that one of the highlights will have you charging into battle, flanked by transport tanks and your fellow troops as you mount an attack on a Nazi bunker.\n- **Trophies:** A German guide says three achievements or trophies can be unlocked in this mission.\n\nFor a full-mission video, try searching YouTube directly for \"Vanguard Operation Tonga walkthrough\" or \"Vanguard campaign mission 1 PS5 4K.\" Those titles usually return complete playthroughs.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"b27f105e-2d05-4789-b9f5-b357a242287f","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:00:50.951Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Call of Duty Vanguard Operation Tonga full mission gameplay youtube","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01YNniSGcQ7WfL4kRFJCUYjm","content":[{"title":"Call of Duty Vanguard on PS5 and Xbox One X – The DVDfever Review","url":"https://dvd-fever.co.uk/call-of-duty-vanguard-on-ps5-and-xbox-one-x-the-dvdfever-review/"},{"title":"92656 call of duty vanguard le battaglie che lo hanno ispirato","url":"https://www.animeclick.it/news/92656-call-of-duty-vanguard-le-battaglie-che-lo-hanno-ispirato"},{"title":"Call of Duty Vanguard le battaglie che lo hanno ispirato","url":"https://www.animeclick.it/news/amp/92656-call-of-duty-vanguard-le-battaglie-che-lo-hanno-ispirato.amp.html"},{"title":"campaign mission list"