{"parentUuid":"30dc724c-1c1d-4af7-a5e1-b0ba965cb096","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17b7ed16-a101-4402-afdd-06026f97016b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NDYjg6jrryVDUiuxJiqnhq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Medal of Honor Airborne Operation Neptune mission gameplay youtube\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medal_of_Honor:_Airborne\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/wd/3030-6026/\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/medal-of-honor-airborne/3030-6026/\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-6026/\"},{\"title\":\"www.giantbomb.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/medal-of-honor-airborne/61-6026/\"},{\"title\":\"www.historynet.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.historynet.com/?p=13738152\"},{\"title\":\"The Let's Play Archive\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Medal-of-Honor-Airborne\"},{\"title\":\"Share This Article\",\"url\":\"https://historynet.com/wwii-review-medal-honor-airborne/\"},{\"title\":\"Joystiq hands-on: Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://www.engadget.com/2007-07-14-joystiq-hands-on-medal-of-honor-airborne.html\"},{\"title\":\"www.cheatcc.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.cheatcc.com/?p=82330\"}]\n\nThe search didn't return any direct YouTube links, but it did turn up useful material on the Operation Neptune mission.\n\n- **Mission setup:** Neptune is the fourth of six missions. The player jumps from a transport plane into France, and the goal is to take and hold Sainte-Mère-Église before the Normandy landings. (Mission 4 - Operation Neptune : Here Travers in air dropped into France and it is up to Travers and CO to take and hold the Ste. Mere Eglise, before the Normandy beach invasion.)\n- **Gameplay style:** The player chooses the landing zone, and that choice affects how the operation unfolds. Once on the ground, you can tackle objectives in the order of your choosing.\n- **Drop-point rule:** Each level has \"drop point objectives\" that you have to achieve to advance, and if you fail several of them, you'll have to re-jump in and start over again.\n- **Video option:** The Let's Play Archive page lists a full episode series hosted on YouTube, including a \"Mission #3: Operation Neptune\" episode and a Neptune skill-drops bonus video. (Videos Hosted on YouTube All Episodes Playlist) The page doesn't give the video URLs, so you'd need to search YouTube for those titles to find them.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"b52be9d4-6d69-48cf-b27c-85a0fbfb67d1","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:00:52.195Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Medal of Honor Airborne Operation Neptune mission gameplay youtube","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_012nkmkoNvTEtfobQZCtow5Q","content":[{"title":"Medal of Honor: Airborne","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medal_of_Honor:_Airborne"},{"title":"Medal of Honor: Airborne","url":"https://www.giantbomb.com/wd/3030-6026/"},{"title":"Medal of Honor: Airborne","url":"https://giantbomb.com/medal-of-honor-airborne/3030-6026/"},{"title":"Medal of Honor: Airborne","url":"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-6026/"},{"title":"www.giantbomb.com","url":"https://www.giantbomb.com/medal-of-honor-airborne/61-6026/"},{"title":"www.historynet.com","url":"https://www.historynet.com/?p=13738152"},{"title":"The Let's Play Archive","url":"https://lparchive.org/Medal-of-Honor-Airborne"},{"title":"Share This Article","url":"https://historynet.com/wwii-review-medal-honor-airborne/"},{"title":"Joystiq hands-on: Medal of Honor: Airborne","url":"https://www.engadget.com/2007-07-14-joystiq-hands-on-medal-of-honor-airborne.html"},{"title":"www.cheatcc.com","url":"https://www.cheatcc.com/?p=82330"}]},"The search didn't return any direct YouTube links, but it did turn up useful material on the Operation Neptune mission.\n\n- **Mission setup:** Neptune is the fourth of six missions. The player jumps from a transport plane into France, and the goal is to take and hold Sainte-Mère-Église before the Normandy landings. (Mission 4 - Operation Neptune : Here Travers in air dropped into France and it is up to Travers and CO to take and hold the Ste. Mere Eglise, before the Normandy beach invasion.)\n- **Gameplay style:** The player chooses the landing zone, and that choice affects how the operation unfolds. Once on the ground, you can tackle objectives in the order of your choosing.\n- **Drop-point rule:** Each level has \"drop point objectives\" that you have to achieve to advance, and if you fail several of them, you'll have to re-jump in and start over again.\n- **Video option:** The Let's Play Archive page lists a full episode series hosted on YouTube, including a \"Mission #3: Operation Neptune\" episode and a Neptune skill-drops bonus video. (Videos Hosted on YouTube All Episodes Playlist) The page doesn't give the video URLs, so you'd need to search YouTube for those titles to find them."],"durationSeconds":5.6062385420054195,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"9bd692fe-e51a-4b76-8c04-3cb4293cac44","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"REDACTED","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":null,"remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]},"error":"not_a_repo"},"live_cwd":"REDACTED","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"30dc724c-1c1d-4af7-a5e1-b0ba965cb096","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"user_permanent","reasonType":"rule"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"REDACTED","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
