{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"7c6694e2687ad4483ae12e9cb7035dcc211d9b533fedcd72a5ece367f66d9bd3","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017NRFGtu6zyqz7znDZbFVUT","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan shown (5 steps)."}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qfedjq59fGW4nAV39DDh5L","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Call of Duty Vanguard Operation Tonga full mission gameplay youtube\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard on PS5 and Xbox One X – The DVDfever Review\",\"url\":\"https://dvd-fever.co.uk/call-of-duty-vanguard-on-ps5-and-xbox-one-x-the-dvdfever-review/\"},{\"title\":\"92656 call of duty vanguard le battaglie che lo hanno ispirato\",\"url\":\"https://www.animeclick.it/news/92656-call-of-duty-vanguard-le-battaglie-che-lo-hanno-ispirato\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty Vanguard le battaglie che lo hanno ispirato\",\"url\":\"https://www.animeclick.it/news/amp/92656-call-of-duty-vanguard-le-battaglie-che-lo-hanno-ispirato.amp.html\"},{\"title\":\"campaign mission list\",\"url\":\"https://www.gfinityesports.com/call-of-duty-vanguard/campaign-mission-list/\"},{\"title\":\"www.gameswelt.de\",\"url\":\"https://www.gameswelt.de/call-of-duty-vanguard/komplettloesung/komplettloesung-guide-fuer-die-kampagne-alle-trophaeen-achievements-311172/2\"},{\"title\":\"Call Of Duty: Vanguard: Operation Tonga Walkthrough -- Where To Hide\",\"url\":\"https://gamespot.REDACTED\"},{\"title\":\"cod vanguard alle missionen spielzeit,3374949\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamepro.de/artikel/cod-vanguard-alle-missionen-spielzeit,3374949.html\"},{\"title\":\"call of duty vanguardset during wwiiwill be released on november 5th\",\"url\":\"https://www.guru3d.com/news-story/call-of-duty-vanguardset-during-wwiiwill-be-released-on-november-5th.html\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty: Vanguard Review (PC) – Familiar Territory\",\"url\":\"https://mp1st.com/?p=169993\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up a YouTube video of the full Operation Tonga mission. It returned written material only, including a walkthrough on GameSpot that covers the mission's opening section and a German guide with trophy details. A DVDfever review also includes a full PS5 gameplay walkthrough of the campaign, though it isn't specific to this mission.\n\nHere's what the results say about the mission:\n\n- **Setup:** In Operation Tonga, you play as Arthur Kingsley, during the British Sixth Airborne Division's assault on Normandy on D-Day.\n- **Opening:** Kingsley loses his equipment, save for a knife, and must proceed to kill some Nazis without his typical gear. The GameSpot guide covers hiding and getting a weapon in that section.\n- **Later stages:** A review notes that one of the highlights will have you charging into battle, flanked by transport tanks and your fellow troops as you mount an attack on a Nazi bunker.\n- **Trophies:** A German guide says three achievements or trophies can be unlocked in this mission.\n\nFor a full-mission video, try searching YouTube directly for \"Vanguard Operation Tonga walkthrough\" or \"Vanguard campaign mission 1 PS5 4K.\" Those titles usually return complete playthroughs.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NDYjg6jrryVDUiuxJiqnhq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Medal of Honor Airborne Operation Neptune mission gameplay youtube\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medal_of_Honor:_Airborne\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/wd/3030-6026/\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/medal-of-honor-airborne/3030-6026/\"},{\"title\":\"Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-6026/\"},{\"title\":\"www.giantbomb.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/medal-of-honor-airborne/61-6026/\"},{\"title\":\"www.historynet.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.historynet.com/?p=13738152\"},{\"title\":\"The Let's Play Archive\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Medal-of-Honor-Airborne\"},{\"title\":\"Share This Article\",\"url\":\"https://historynet.com/wwii-review-medal-honor-airborne/\"},{\"title\":\"Joystiq hands-on: Medal of Honor: Airborne\",\"url\":\"https://www.engadget.com/2007-07-14-joystiq-hands-on-medal-of-honor-airborne.html\"},{\"title\":\"www.cheatcc.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.cheatcc.com/?p=82330\"}]\n\nThe search didn't return any direct YouTube links, but it did turn up useful material on the Operation Neptune mission.\n\n- **Mission setup:** Neptune is the fourth of six missions. The player jumps from a transport plane into France, and the goal is to take and hold Sainte-Mère-Église before the Normandy landings. (Mission 4 - Operation Neptune : Here Travers in air dropped into France and it is up to Travers and CO to take and hold the Ste. Mere Eglise, before the Normandy beach invasion.)\n- **Gameplay style:** The player chooses the landing zone, and that choice affects how the operation unfolds. Once on the ground, you can tackle objectives in the order of your choosing.\n- **Drop-point rule:** Each level has \"drop point objectives\" that you have to achieve to advance, and if you fail several of them, you'll have to re-jump in and start over again.\n- **Video option:** The Let's Play Archive page lists a full episode series hosted on YouTube, including a \"Mission #3: Operation Neptune\" episode and a Neptune skill-drops bonus video. (Videos Hosted on YouTube All Episodes Playlist) The page doesn't give the video URLs, so you'd need to search YouTube for those titles to find them.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]}}
