{"parentUuid":"2640500b-5050-4008-8964-5f39aae9f839","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17b7ed16-a101-4402-afdd-06026f97016b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019noGnvJcaMjrJzBzVT89mb","type":"tool_result","content":"The page doesn't link to separate archive pages for each update. Its links all point to YouTube, so these are the full URLs as given:\n\n**Operation Neptune (highlighted)**\n- Briefing #3: Operation Neptune: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rDGmyVlthKU8 (ID: `rDGmyVlthKU8`)\n- Mission #3: Operation Neptune: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IMb3E2g6u40 (ID: `IMb3E2g6u40`)\n- Skill drops in Operation Neptune: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xbBcVf2K5ZY (ID: `xbBcVf2K5ZY`)\n\nThe briefing ID is 12 characters, while YouTube IDs are normally 11, so it may be a typo on the page.\n\n**Sainte-Mère-Église:** The page doesn't mention it.\n\n**Main episodes**\n- Training: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NXw_KuFcsT0 (`NXw_KuFcsT0`)\n- Briefing #1, Operation Husky: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=skhZ1Rmjqsg (`skhZ1Rmjqsg`)\n- Mission #1, Operation Husky: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U2vnsiP5KvU (`U2vnsiP5KvU`)\n- Briefing #2, Operation Avalanche: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a21wR8P9v98 (`a21wR8P9v98`)\n- Mission #2, Operation Avalanche: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ho-J7YqHAos (`ho-J7YqHAos`)\n- Briefing #4, Operation Market Garden: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmGzZ5YDc6c (`mmGzZ5YDc6c`)\n- Mission #4, Operation Market Garden: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=paMoyX7z_8E (`paMoyX7z_8E`)\n- Briefing #5, Operation Varsity: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x9tRtMNBM5c (`x9tRtMNBM5c`)\n- Mission #5, Operation Varsity: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CcL_Wjn2kPs (`CcL_Wjn2kPs`)\n- Briefing #6, Der Flaktürm: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c8T8c4FU6zg (`c8T8c4FU6zg`)\n- Mission #6, Der Flaktürm: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kG1JR2w3bAY (`kG1JR2w3bAY`)\n\n**Skill drops**\n- Operation Husky: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pEcdsMAUZnc (`pEcdsMAUZnc`)\n- Operation Avalanche: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g5ilPlYKJDA (`g5ilPlYKJDA`)\n- Operation Market Garden: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DcYbqEyV6uQ (`DcYbqEyV6uQ`)\n- Operation Varsity: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zEq5sUxLRc4 (`zEq5sUxLRc4`)\n- Der Flaktürm: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9diIEIru_6g (`9diIEIru_6g`)\n\n**Other videos**\n- How to build a Cinematic: `U_ChppMSWvY`\n- Designing a Drop: `v2eLoJ4oj1A`\n- Weapon Audio: `cpeabV9L15c`\n- Building a Killer Mission: `rn4AnNGSKus`\n- Final Flight: `HQVOwYFr3dI`\n- Visual Concepts: `D1A6_-HB2ww`\n- Affordance Engine: `c9-LhdFj7sE`\n- Cover video tutorial: `E84vVP6KtqU`\n- Advanced Movements video tutorial: `bBHGTm4LC78`\n- Advanced Grenade Usage video tutorial: `DB2Y6XbOpfI`\n- Advanced Sniper Rifle Usage video tutorial: `7VgUrPytT0c`\n\nAll of these use the form `http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=[ID]`.\n\n**Playlist:** http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLDA80594B1BE69E5B&feature=view_all"}]},"uuid":"d69a50f4-c9d1-44e2-ba05-514f01e54140","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:01:09.463Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":15211,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"The page doesn't link to separate archive pages for each update. Its links all point to YouTube, so these are the full URLs as given:\n\n**Operation Neptune (highlighted)**\n- Briefing #3: Operation Neptune: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rDGmyVlthKU8 (ID: `rDGmyVlthKU8`)\n- Mission #3: Operation Neptune: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IMb3E2g6u40 (ID: `IMb3E2g6u40`)\n- Skill drops in Operation Neptune: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xbBcVf2K5ZY (ID: `xbBcVf2K5ZY`)\n\nThe briefing ID is 12 characters, while YouTube IDs are normally 11, so it may be a typo on the page.\n\n**Sainte-Mère-Église:** The page doesn't mention it.\n\n**Main episodes**\n- Training: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NXw_KuFcsT0 (`NXw_KuFcsT0`)\n- Briefing #1, Operation Husky: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=skhZ1Rmjqsg (`skhZ1Rmjqsg`)\n- Mission #1, Operation Husky: http://www.youtu