{"parentUuid":"444d80ac-ac18-4709-956f-2a361fefb2d0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGTucQrh2mkUz2hXTg3C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CkLw9VBRSeCfYdv72batUH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, sixth:\n  References without the pane: hl.mjs gained `view <url> <out.png>` (a throwaway headless tab,\n  Page.captureScreenshot, closed; screenshots kept in scratch only while comparing, then deleted).\n  MoH: Airborne LP (lparchive.org/Medal-of-Honor-Airborne -> YouTube IDs; Neptune mission IMb3E2g6u40,\n  skill drops xbBcVf2K5ZY): img.youtube.com/vi/<id>/hq1|hq2|hq3.jpg are frames at 25/50/75%. Neptune\n  is daytime/overcast: trenches with concertina and barbed-wire posts, stained concrete, dirt clods\n  thrown by blasts, the parachute drop. Compared with our trench/bunker area (night, very dark).\n- fd184b5e concertina (wire.js): along each barbed_wire prop (levelBuild passes {x,y,z,yaw,len from\n  m.box}), a coil r ~0.4 m, PITCH 0.2, 20 samples/loop, 5-sided tube, alternating loop tilt\n  0.42 cos(a/2) (crossing diamonds), sag, lean; vertex shader widens to max(2.8 mm, dist * 0.0011).\n  Gotchas: tube winding was inside-out at first (only the far inner side drew - visible only with\n  emissive); rust #6e5a48 + metal 0.35 matched the night ground (10.3 vs 11.7 grey levels under it);\n  a white matte test proved the lighting; galvanised #8a8378 m0.45 r0.36 reads up close by a light,\n  a faint tangle at 3-4 m in the dark forest.\n  Checked: low/medium/high compile, 9 node checks, merge-tree clean. Headless renders only.\nEOF\nrm -rf REDACTED && echo \"reference screenshots deleted\"; cd REDACTED && node hl.mjs stop; for i in $(seq 1 15); do pgrep -f chrome-headless-shell >/dev/null || break; sleep 1; done; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; pgrep -fl chrome-headless-shell || echo \"no headless processes\"; pgrep -fl \"nocache_server.py\" || echo \"no test server\"; lsof -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"8766 still listening\" || echo \"8766 free\"; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass status --short | head -3; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass log --oneline -2","description":"Write notes, delete references, shut down the rig","timeout":60000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1342,"cache_read_input_tokens":909958,"output_tokens":1539,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":156},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1342,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1539,"cache_read_input_tokens":909958,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1342,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1342},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01CkLw9VBRSeCfYdv72batUH":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, sixth:\n  References without the pane: hl.mjs gained `view <url> <out.png>` (a throwaway headless tab,\n  Page.captureScreenshot, closed; screenshots kept in scratch only while comparing, then deleted).\n  MoH: Airborne LP (lparchive.org/Medal-of-Honor-Airborne -> YouTube IDs; Neptune mission IMb3E2g6u40,\n  skill drops xbBcVf2K5ZY): img.youtube.com/vi/<id>/hq1|hq2|hq3.jpg are frames at 25/50/75%. Neptune\n  is daytime/overcast: trenches with concertina and barbed-wire posts, stained concrete, dirt clods\n  thrown by blasts, the parachute drop. Compared with our trench/bunker area (night, very dark).\n- fd184b5e concertina (wire.js): along each barbed_wire prop (levelBuild passes {x,y,z,yaw,len from\n  m.box}), a coil r ~0.4 m, PITCH 0.2, 20 samples/loop, 5-sided tube, alternating loop tilt\n  0.42 cos(a/2) (crossing diamonds), sag, lean; vertex shader widens to max(2.8 mm, dist * 0.0011).\n  Gotchas: tube winding was inside-out at first (only the far inner side drew - visible only with\n  emissive); rust #6e5a48 + metal 0.35 matched the night ground (10.3 vs 11.7 grey levels under it);\n  a white matte test proved the lighting; galvanised #8a8378 m0.45 r0.36 reads up close by a light,\n  a faint tangle at 3-4 m in the dark forest.\n  Checked: low/medium/high compile, 9 node checks, merge-tree clean. Headless renders only.\nEOF\nrm -rf REDACTED && echo \"reference screenshots deleted\"; cd REDACTED && node hl.mjs stop; for i in $(seq 1 15); do pgrep -f chrome-headless-shell >/dev/null || break; sleep 1; done; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; pgrep -fl chrome-headless-shell || echo \"no headless processes\"; pgrep -fl \"nocache_server.py\" || echo \"no test server\"; lsof -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"8766 still listening\" || echo \"8766 free\"; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass status --short | head -3; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass log --oneline -2","description":"Write notes, delete references, shut down the rig","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":60000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b988a292-e683-4240-a796-44c1cccc8f8b","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgGTubbkLLY9Eaesov99T","requestRef":"3ab35ef2-045c-4813-9dea-c6174b00d5bf","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"46a07406-f8ed-4fde-afb1-cd0c049abc55","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:11:53.583Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort