{"parentUuid":"7dcae800-d2b9-44aa-b1f9-be5e5da32df2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGURgUWXNXqFZkZWfQ1z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This round's improvement is **2a1466a3: boot prints in the mud of the lane and the forest track.**\n\nAAA battlefields show the marks of the troops who crossed them. Our lane and track were smooth mud with wheel ruts, and nothing said anyone had marched there. They now carry 993 boot prints:\n- lines of soldiers walking along them, a pace apart, left and right either side of each man's line;\n- some heading toward the village and some coming back;\n- now and then a print missing, one scuffed where a heel slid, one with rain standing in it;\n- only on mud, never on the cobbles, the grass or the leaf litter.\n\nEach print is a sunken sole and heel with a rim of pushed-up mud, hobnail pits and the groove of a heel iron. In the dark they read as darker marks in the mud, and under a flare the boot shape shows clearly.\n\nAll three quality presets compile, the 9 node checks pass, and the commit merges cleanly with hedgerow-poc. Nothing is pushed. I checked it only in headless renders, not in a browser window. The test server and headless browser are stopped, and the details are in the shared notes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":232,"cache_read_input_tokens":953058,"output_tokens":373,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":232,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":373,"cache_read_input_tokens":953058,"cache_creation_input_tokens":232,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":232},"type":"message"}],"speed":"st